description: Stack migration context — read before any work in this repo
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

This repository is migrating from Django 5 + HTMX/Alpine + Tailwind to TanStack Start + React (frontend), NestJS + Fastify (API), StyleX (CSS), Prisma + pg-boss (data/jobs). Read `docs/migration/00-overview.md` and `AGENTS.md` first.

- The Django app (`apps/`, `providers/`, `templates/`, `config/`) is the LIVE product. Never break it.
- New-stack code lives in `apps/web` (TanStack Start), `apps/api` (NestJS), `apps/worker` (pg-boss), `packages/shared`.
- Never mix legacy-feature work and migration work in the same commit.
- External contracts are frozen: `/api/v1/*`, `/webhooks/*`, `/oauth/*`, `.well-known/*`, `/social-accounts/callback/{platform}/`. Do not change paths or payload shapes without human approval.
- Encryption-at-rest must stay byte-compatible with `apps/common/encryption.py` (HKDF-SHA256 from SECRET_KEY + ENCRYPTION_KEY_SALT, AES-256-GCM, base64(nonce||ct)).
